A kinematics switch whose forward kinematics cannot solve the current
joint position must leave the type in force, the joints and the position
alone, report the failure and abort; motion goes on working in the
kinematics it kept.

The hexapod module starts in identity kinematics here, so the joints are
put at a few units each as coordinates.  Six struts that short are not a
platform position the hexapod forward can converge to, so G12.1 P1 asks
for exactly that switch.
